  "description": "A zombie apocalypse breaks out at Seoul Tower, a super-large shopping mall, and the government puts zombies in the tower to block it to quell the situation.  \nKim In-jong is not rescued and lives for a year in a tower full of zombies.  \nAs it turns out, not only Kim In-jong, but a few people seem to be secretly living in hiding.  \nWhat is going on inside this mysterious tower where humans and zombies coexist?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=766648), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5918026)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/action/we-are-the-zombies/list?title_no=3158), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/action/we-are-the-zombies/list?title_no=4331), [S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/COMEDY/moribinansuo/list?title_no=1661), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/heartwarming/zombies/list?title_no=4365), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002800)",
